5) Run around triggering traps before you do.

The first reason is very important until you've found an altar,
because in the early game, you want to be trying on as much
armor as you can.  And until you've got magic resistence or
polymorph control, it's generally far, far preferrable that
your pet hit the polymorph trap before you do.

On the down side, your pet has to eat, too, and in the early
game, food is often a scarce resource.  But I still generally
manage to keep them without starving.  (A bit of prayer helps.)

